s to investigate the ghost in the house to determine the type and characteristics of the ghost. You must go through the tutorial to grasp some basic skill. \nNow we offer you $1500 as a initial funding, a two hours online time for free,and unlock the whole 3 maps for early access at very first time! Just rush to find some Exorcists,and enjoy the breath-taking trip and a creepy summer time!\nFor better game experience, just join our Community-Discord\uff1a https://discord.gg/XTQSvRyuNs", "short_description": "\"Exorcism Agency Demo\" is a new packaged version base on Exorcism Agency official version v106. Now you have chance to experiencing multiplayer func with all exorcism tools and 3 maps. Taste the creepy moment and team up with your friends to exorcism it! "}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.atombits.cn/privacy-policy-3", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "AtomBits Studio", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.atombits.cn/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": null, "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "644354873106712"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "fr", "es", "ru", "zh_CN"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER", "CO_OP", "SINGLE_USER"], "id": "26766605256271601"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 4, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1511869650992519"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "652485130853148"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "535997136180533"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "4643784